					Level readers, books, games, and videos built for young readers and curious minds.
					Designed to make learning fun, engaging, and accessible.
				</p>

			</section>

			<nav class="quick-nav">
				<a href="#books" class="quick-nav-item">
					<svg class="nav-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2"
						stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
						<path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z" />
